  "title": "Review: Bridge",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "One verb, five times:\n\n- **করছি** I am doing · **করি** I do\n- **করলাম** I did · **করেছি** I have done · **করিনি** I didn't / haven't\n- **করব** I will do\n\nAnd the persons: আমি **-ি / -লাম / -ব**, তুমি **-ো / -লে / -বে**, সে **-ে / -ল / -বে**, আপনি **-েন / -লেন / -বেন**.",
  "vocab": [],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "e01",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Catching up",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "কাল তুমি কী করলে?",
          "tr": "kal tumi ki korle?",
          "en": "What did you do yesterday?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "কাল আমি বন্ধুর বাসায় গেলাম। ওখানে অনেক খেলাম!",
          "tr": "kal ami bondhur bashay gelam. okhane onek khelam!",
          "en": "Yesterday I went to a friend's. I ate a lot there!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "আজ কী করছো?",
          "tr": "aj ki korchho?",
          "en": "What are you doing today?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "আজ আমি বাসায় আছি। এখনো নাস্তা খাইনি।",
          "tr": "aj ami bashay achhi. ekhono nashta khaini.",
          "en": "Today I'm at home. I haven't had breakfast yet."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "সামনের সপ্তাহে আমরা সিলেটে যাব। তুমি কি আসতে পারবে?",
          "tr": "shamner shoptahe amra shilete jabo. tumi ki ashte parbe?",
          "en": "Next week we're going to Sylhet. Can you come?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, আমি যেতে চাই!",
          "tr": "hya~, ami jete chai!",
          "en": "Yes, I want to go!"
        }
      ],
      "question": "Where did Nadia go yesterday?",
      "options": [
        "To Sylhet",
        "To a friend's home",
        "To the office"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "why": "**গেলাম** 'I went', **খেলাম** 'I ate'."
    },
